  "leProgram": "% Logical English reading of \"Facility Agreement (sample)\", revision 1, generated by the word authoring POC.\n% Profile wap-le-forms 0.1.0. Not checked by an LE parser.\n\nthe templates are:\n    *a party* shall pay interest on *a thing* at *a rate* per annum.\n    *a thing* shall be deemed *a state*.\n    *a party* shall not *an activity*.\n    *a party* shall *an activity*.\n    if *a condition*, *a party* may *an activity*.\n    *a party* may *an activity*.\n    *a term* means *a description*.\n\nthe knowledge base facility_agreement includes:\n\n% 1.1 Definition (form definition)\n\u201cBorrower\u201d means the company named as borrower in the schedule.\n\n% 1.2 Definition (form definition)\n\u201cLender\u201d means each bank listed in Part 1 of the schedule.\n\n% 1.3 Definition (form definition)\n\u201cLoan\u201d means a loan made or to be made under the Facility.\n\n% 1.4 Definition (form definition)\n\u201cFacility\u201d means the term loan facility made available under this Agreement.\n\n% 1.5 Definition (form definition)\n\u201cRepayment Date\u201d means the date falling five years after the date of this Agreement.\n\n% 2.1 Obligation (form obligation)\nLender shall make available to Borrower a term loan facility in an aggregate amount equal to GBP 10,000,000.\n\n% 2.2 Permission (form permission)\nBorrower may cancel the whole or any part of the Facility on not less than five Business Days' prior notice.\n\n% 3.1 Obligation (form pay-interest-at-rate)\nBorrower shall pay interest on each Loan at 2.5 per cent per annum.\n\n% 3.2 Obligation (keyword)\nInterest shall be calculated on the basis of a 365 day year.\n\n% 4.1 Obligation (form obligation)\nBorrower shall repay each Loan in full on the Repayment Date.\n\n% 4.2 Obligation (form obligation)\nBorrower shall pay a prepayment fee of GBP 250 for each prepayment.\n\n% 5.1 Prohibition (form prohibition)\nBorrower shall not create any security over its assets.\n\n% 5.2 Obligation (form obligation)\nBorrower shall supply its annual financial statements to the [Agent] within 120 days of each financial year end.\n\n% 6.1 Power (form power-on-condition)\nIf Borrower does not pay any sum due under this Agreement, Lender may declare all Loans immediately due.\n\n% 6.2 Deeming (form deemed-shall)\nA Loan shall be deemed due on the date a demand is made.\n",
